#. Description of the theme
#: style.css:6
msgid "A calm, type-led theme for cleaning companies and other local service businesses. Clear header with a phone line, a side panel with contact details and the areas you cover, a call and WhatsApp bar on phones, light and dark mode, and a blog with a featured article, reading times and a contents list. Ten block patterns (hero, services, prices, how it works, figures, reviews, questions, call to action) and a Landing page template let you build a full home page with the block editor, no plugins needed. Everything is set under Appearance > Customize > Theme options."
msgstr ""

